  voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a58f5f3e092154c4eb6e1a60b3c89bcd, type: 3}
  lines:
  - text: You made it out.
    startTime: 0
    endTime: 2
  - text: "I could tell there was so much around me\u2026  I wonder how big this
      place is."
    startTime: 2
    endTime: 9
  - text: ' Watcher:As big as you can imagine.'
    startTime: 10
    endTime: 11
  - text: Do you know a lot about this place?
    startTime: 11
    endTime: 12
  - text: "Watcher: No, not at all.  I\u2019m sure you know much more than I do."
    startTime: 12
    endTime: 19
  - text: "Right\u2026  I don\u2019t know why I\u2019m talking to voices in my head\u2026"
    startTime: 20
    endTime: 24
  - text: 'Watcher: Oh, come on. Firstly, you can call us The Watcher. '
    startTime: 25
    endTime: 29
  - text: Secondly, everyone needs a friend in stressful times.  Indulge us a bit
      more, what did you think about that place?
    startTime: 30
    endTime: 35
